  "title": "The Quiet Revolution of Smart Cities",
  "summary": "Smart cities aren’t about futuristic gadgets—they’re about making the infrastructure we already have intelligent. In this episode, we explore how AI, computer vision, and edge computing are transforming cameras, sensors, and connected infrastructure into real-time awareness systems that can improve public safety, optimize transportation, reduce costs, and help cities respond faster when every second […] The post The Quiet Revolution of Smart Cities appeared first on GSI Technology .",
